{"generated":"2026-05-25T12:33:30.031462+00:00","period_start":"2026-05-18T15:31:00+00:00","period_end":"2026-05-25T10:18:00+00:00","snapshot_count":30,"html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>The Vendetta Gazette – June 1, 1926</title>\n<style>\nbody { font-family: Georgia, serif; background: #f5ecd7; color: #1a1a1a; max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }\nh1 { text-align: center; font-size: 2.8em; letter-spacing: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; border-top: 6px double #1a1a1a; border-bottom: 6px double #1a1a1a; padding: 10px 0; margin-bottom: 4px; }\nh2 { text-align: center; font-size: 1em; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-top: 2px; margin-bottom: 16px; }\nh3 { font-size: 1.35em; text-transform: uppercase; border-bottom: 2px solid #1a1a1a; margin-top: 24px; }\np { line-height: 1.75; margin: 10px 0; text-align: justify; }\nblockquote { background: #e8d9b5; border: 3px double #1a1a1a; margin: 20px 0; padding: 16px 20px; font-style: italic; }\nblockquote strong { display: block; font-style: normal; font-size: 1.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a1a; padding-bottom: 4px; }\nhr { border: none; border-top: 3px double #1a1a1a; margin: 28px 0; }\n.subhead { font-style: italic; font-size: 1.05em; display: block; margin-top: -6px; margin-bottom: 10px; color: #444; }\n.byline { font-size: 0.85em; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #555; margin-bottom: 16px; display: block; }\n.leaderboard { background: #1a1a1a; color: #f5ecd7; padding: 12px 18px; margin: 16px 0; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 0.92em; }\n.leaderboard strong { display: block; text-align: center; font-size: 1.1em; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f5ecd7; padding-bottom: 4px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<h1>The Vendetta Gazette</h1>\n<h2>Vol. XII &bull; June 1, 2026 &bull; &ldquo;All the Blood That&rsquo;s Fit to Print&rdquo; &bull; Two Cents (If You&rsquo;re Still Alive to Pay)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"leaderboard\">\n  <strong>&#9733; TERRITORY GAINS THIS WEEK &#9733;</strong>\n  Sir Caprice &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; +110 turfs<br>\n  Donald Trump &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; +43 turfs<br>\n  Cokro &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; +11 turfs<br>\n  Free Willy &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; +4 turfs<br>\n  Wu-Tang &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; +2 turfs<br>\n  Ace Sabo Luffy Law &nbsp; +1 turf<br>\n  Samrat &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; +1 turf<br>\n  Bestytor &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; +1 turf\n</div>\n\n<h3>A Tempest Named Caprice — One Hundred and Ten Turfs Seized in a Single Furious Week</h3>\n<span class=\"subhead\">The Newcomer Who Consumed Last Week's Scraps and Emerged as a Titan of Vendetta City</span>\n<span class=\"byline\">By Our Man in the Trenches, Ignatius P. Flambeau</span>\n\n<p>This correspondent has, in recent weeks, devoted considerable column inches to the golden conquests of Donald Trump, the Platinum Pompadour, whose back-to-back hauls of forty-one and forty-three turfs have reshaped the map of Vendetta City like a hot iron pressed upon soft wax. And yet — brace yourselves, dear readers, for the smelling salts may be required — it is <strong>Sir Caprice</strong> who has this week stolen the crown, the throne, and very likely the wallpaper from the throne room. One hundred and ten turfs. Say it aloud, savour its enormity: <em>one hundred and ten.</em></p>\n\n<p>Last week, Sir Caprice arrived on these pages as a promising lieutenant, claiming a modest thirteen turfs and drawing only modest notice. This week, he has returned as a conquering generalissimo, orchestrating no fewer than one hundred and eight territorial assaults across the ravaged districts of Vendetta City. His particular appetites ran toward the already-weakened — the twitching remnants of Selyn, the gutted holdings of Wcrypto, the crumbling fiefdom of Gpug GIka — but a conqueror who seizes opportunity is no less a conqueror for it.</p>\n\n<p>Nor was Sir Caprice content with mere bricks and mortar. His raiders swept through enemy vaults on forty-eight separate loot operations, extracting cash, weapons and intelligence from targets left too thin to mount a proper defence. The man is not simply a general — he is an <em>industry.</em></p>\n\n<hr>\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"640\" height=\"276\" style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;background:#0a0800;display:block;margin:18px auto\">\n<text x=\"320\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" letter-spacing=\"2\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">TERRITORY GAINS THIS WEEK</text>\n<line x1=\"20\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"620\" y2=\"28\" stroke=\"#3a2a00\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Sir Caprice</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"35\" width=\"400\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"566\" y=\"48\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">+110</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Donald Trump</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"63\" width=\"156\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"322\" y=\"76\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">+43</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Cokro</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"91\" width=\"40\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"206\" y=\"104\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">+11</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Free Willy</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"119\" width=\"14\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"180\" y=\"132\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">+4</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"160\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Wu-Tang</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"147\" width=\"7\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"173\" y=\"160\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">+2</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Ace Sabo Luffy Law</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"175\" width=\"3\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"169\" y=\"188\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">+1</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"216\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Samrat</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"203\" width=\"3\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"169\" y=\"216\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">+1</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"244\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Bestytor</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"231\" width=\"3\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"169\" y=\"244\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">+1</text>\n</svg>\n\n\n<h3>Trump's Juggernaut Rolls Ever Onward — The Emperor Fortifies His Vast Domain</h3>\n<span class=\"subhead\">Forty-Three More Turfs, Three Hundred and Seventy-Eight New Soldiers — Platinum Pompadour Builds for War</span>\n\n<p>Donald Trump, the Golden Emperor whose systematic demolition of Wcrypto last week left this city gasping, has wasted precisely no time in consolidating his gains. Forty-three fresh turfs have been folded into his already-immense domain this week, matched — and here is the detail that should keep rival bosses awake and sweating — by a garrison expansion of <strong>three hundred and seventy-eight gangsters</strong>, bringing his standing army to a staggering five thousand, six hundred and fifty-five souls. The man is not merely conquering; he is <em>fortifying.</em> Every turf taken is a turret built, every new henchman a brick in a wall that grows taller by the hour.</p>\n\n<p>One notes with grim interest that Wcrypto, last week's principal victim, continues to haemorrhage. Eighty-three garrison units stripped away, forty-three turfs carved from what remains of his holdings, and his treasury looted thirty-three times by parties showing all the mercy of January creditors. The buzzards, it seems, are not yet satisfied.</p>\n\n<hr>\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"640\" height=\"220\" style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;background:#0a0800;display:block;margin:18px auto\">\n<text x=\"320\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" letter-spacing=\"2\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">HEAVIEST LOSSES THIS WEEK</text>\n<line x1=\"20\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"620\" y2=\"28\" stroke=\"#3a2a00\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Selyn</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"35\" width=\"400\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"566\" y=\"48\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">-62</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Wcrypto</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"63\" width=\"277\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"443\" y=\"76\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">-43</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Gpug GIka</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"91\" width=\"264\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"430\" y=\"104\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">-41</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">FIFTH BLOOD EMPEROR</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"119\" width=\"12\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"178\" y=\"132\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">-2</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"160\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Quinn</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"147\" width=\"6\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"172\" y=\"160\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">-1</text>\n<text x=\"154\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">cmmxunecg</text>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"175\" width=\"6\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n<text x=\"172\" y=\"188\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">-1</text>\n</svg>\n\n\n<blockquote>\n<strong>&#9733; Special Bulletin: The Four Executions of Sir Caprice &#9733;</strong>\nIn a week already dripping with sensation, the most theatrical chapter belongs entirely to Sir Caprice, who captured not one, not two, but <strong>four enemy Headquarters</strong> between the nineteenth and twenty-fourth of May. Quinn fell first — her HQ overrun on the nineteenth, her last turf with it, leaving her eliminated from the board entirely. The obscure operator known only as cmmxunecg suffered the same fate the following evening. Then came <strong>Selyn</strong> — already bleeding from sixty-five territorial captures and sixteen raids — who endured the ind\n<hr>\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"640\" height=\"85\" style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;background:#0a0800;display:block;margin:18px auto\">\n<text x=\"320\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#c8a84a\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" letter-spacing=\"2\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">HQ RAIDS — TOP ATTACKERS</text>\n<line x1=\"20\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"620\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#3a2a00\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<text x=\"148\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#a09060\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">Sir Caprice</text>\n<polygon points=\"156,43 161,48 156,53 151,48\" fill=\"#8b1a1a\"/>\n<rect x=\"170\" y=\"41\" width=\"410\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#6b1010\" opacity=\"0.9\" rx=\"1\"/>\n<rect x=\"577\" y=\"41\" width=\"3\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#c03030\"/>\n<text x=\"588\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#c04040\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">4✕</text>\n</svg>","stats":{"total_tiles_start":21606,"total_tiles_end":21629,"hq_captures":4,"raids":175,"pure_captures":86,"capture_and_raids":70,"pure_raids":19,"total_cash_looted":23771.35,"newcomers":3,"vanished":3,"top_gainer":"Sir Caprice","top_gainer_net":110}}